    "text": "Not yet. I want a hobby I can share with my brother, but our fitness levels are different. He is a keen athlete, and I have only recently started to exercise.\n\nYes, we have. We borrowed a racket each from the center last year, and I enjoyed it. He wants to try a different sport this time.\n\nThat sounds good. My brother has already tried basketball, but I have never played volleyball. We could learn together.\n\nI enjoy music, but my brother prefers a game with a ball. Let's book the ten o'clock session. How much does it cost?\n\nI will tell him tonight. Could we cycle there? He has a bicycle, and I can borrow one.\n\nIs there a competition at the stadium that day too? I would like to watch a match after our session.\n\nGreat. I do not mind who will win or lose. It will be fun to see how each opponent works with their team.",
